comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-05T11:59:56.790Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-05: searched all statuses for retry_already_attempted, tag-push Release selection, workflow_dispatch recovery, and blocker closure. Closed pm-lwnifd owns successful exact-tag publication; open pm-e70zh5 owns aggregate release reliability; open pm-ei6x66 owns cross-environment gate governance. None owns the issue-closure query selecting a stale failed push run over a newer successful dispatch recovery. Direct evidence: runs 31001951195, 31002881238, 30994468126 and GitHub #898."
  "2026-08-05T12:05:56.600Z","harness:codex","CI evidence: PR #906 exact-head static gate failed only tracker-measurement validation because this newly filed open item omitted estimated_minutes. Declared a 360-minute ceiling for the workflow, executable contracts, operator docs, and production verification scope; item remains open and unclaimed for a future implementation tranche."
  "2026-08-15T09:02:29.565Z","harness:codex","Production reproduction 2026-08-15: after successful guarded Auto Release run 31873678893 published immutable v2026.8.15, closing blocker GH-1017 triggered issues-event retry run 31874957449 on release commit fbb7bd44d. The workflow ran hosted-analysis before its existing-release/retry classification, refused the direct-main generated release commit, skipped the pipeline's success/skip recording steps, and reopened the resolved blocker as an unrecorded failure. This is the same canonical stale post-recovery rerun family already owned here; no new PM item was created."
  "2026-08-15T09:14:02.160Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the new selector suite failed first because release-run-selection.mjs did not exist, then passed 41 focused unit/integration contracts after implementation. Live read-only controls selected successful tag-push run 31874087916 for v2026.8.15 and successful workflow_dispatch run 31001951195 over failed historical push run 30994468126 for v2026.8.5. No tag, release, package, issue, or workflow state was mutated by these controls."
  "2026-08-15T09:32:15.300Z","harness:codex","Verification note: repository-static-quality passed all assurance, package-boundary, graph, SDK-surface, and entrypoint checks but the cold local transport-floor sample measured claim at 423ms against the 415ms ceiling. No ratchet was changed; rerunning the exact benchmark warm to distinguish host noise from a regression before repeating the full static gate."
  "2026-08-15T09:37:22.239Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: 42 focused unit/integration tests pass, including executable same-day marker recording and duplicate-refusal behavior. Full repository coverage passed exactly 100/100/100/100 (53,483 statements, 51,650 lines, 10,981 functions, 39,492 branches). Build, typecheck, docs/skills, repository static quality, package boundary, SDK surface/cost, graph composition, record integrity, YAML parsing, formatting, and credential scan all pass. The transport-floor gate had two transient 7-8ms host-load misses, then passed unchanged across all six operations; no assurance ratchet was weakened."
  "2026-08-15T09:38:39.570Z","harness:codex","Delivery PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1027 at exact head 7adc66976. The PR links this canonical item and includes the implementation, executable contracts, operator docs, and production-control plan."
  "2026-08-15T10:01:50.584Z","harness:codex","Review-loop evidence: accepted CodeRabbit findings on unbounded archived-log fallback and unguarded title-matched dispatch branches. The fix now requires explicit default-branch identity for every dispatch candidate, limits legacy evidence to at most five completed successful same-day/default-branch dispatches, and stops after the first exact RELEASE_TAG match. Focused 42-test suite, live v2026.8.15 and historical v2026.8.5 controls, full 501-file/7,375-test coverage at 100/100/100/100, typecheck, lint/static assurance, docs/skills, formatting, YAML parse, and credential scan all pass."
  "2026-08-15T10:20:21.602Z","harness:codex","Production and merge evidence 2026-08-15: PR #1027 merged as 4ad0e978f8a36e1ccdc44a09b314a3261fe7c78d after all exact-head checks passed, CodeRabbit confirmed both findings addressed, and zero review threads remained. Exact-main CI 31878905325, CodeQL 31878905360, Security and Script Quality 31878905348, Docs 31878905311, OSSF Scorecard 31878905310, and CodSpeed 31878905361 all completed successfully. Issue-event Auto Release run 31878905982 detected existing v2026.8.15 before preparation work, selected successful immutable publication run 31874087916, wrote the retry marker and success receipt, and left GH #1017 closed. It did not dispatch or rerun Release. Uniqueness proof: one tag at fbb7bd44d89d7d393b843e19f28dcb7f99367562, one GitHub Release, one npm @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.8.15 artifact, and exactly one matching successful Release workflow."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-15T10:20:20.970Z","harness:codex","Classify an existing immutable daily tag before analyzer, dependency, and build work. Exact-tag publication evidence is authoritative only when the commit SHA matches, and guarded workflow_dispatch evidence must originate from the configured default branch; successful immutable publication outranks stale failures."
